---

<section class="hero-section py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <p
      class="hero-line text-sm md:text-base text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-4"
      data-reveal="up"
    >
      프론트엔드 엔지니어
    </p>
    <h1
      class="hero-line text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-6"
      data-reveal="up"
      data-reveal-delay="100"
    >
      장선규
    </h1>
    <p
      class="hero-line text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10"
      data-reveal="up"
      data-reveal-delay="200"
    >
      서비스 성장, 성능, SEO, 운영 효율까지<br class="hidden md:block" />
      연결해 문제를 해결합니다.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-line flex flex-wrap gap-4" data-reveal="up" data-reveal-delay="300">
      <a
        href="/work"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-slate-200 text-white dark:text-slate-900 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-300 transition-colors"
      >
        경력 보기
        <svg
          class="w-4 h-4 arrow-icon"
          fill="none"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
        >
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/articles/astro-script-behavior"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 border border-gray-300 dark:border-slate-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg hover:border-gray-400 dark:hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors"
      >
        아티클 보기
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
